### ─────────────────────────────────────────
###  CARTS  (/api/carts)   [AuthGuard required]
### ─────────────────────────────────────────

### Get All Carts [AdminGuard]
GET http://localhost:3000/api/carts/all

### Get Current Client's Cart  [ClientGuard]
GET http://localhost:3000/api/carts/currentCart

### Pay For Cart  [ClientGuard]
POST http://localhost:3000/api/carts/pay
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "method": "PayPal",
    "amount": 62.8
}

### Pay For Cart – Credit Card  [ClientGuard]
POST http://localhost:3000/api/carts/pay
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "method": "Credit Card",
    "amount": 120.0
}


### ─────────────────────────────────────────
###  RESERVATIONS  (/api/reservations)   [AuthGuard + ClientGuard required]
### ─────────────────────────────────────────

### Add Vehicle To Cart
PATCH http://localhost:3000/api/reservations/addVehicle
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "vehicleId": 6,
    "distance": 40
}

### Remove Order Item From Cart
PATCH http://localhost:3000/api/reservations/removeOrderItem/3
